---
import Default from "../layouts/default.astro";
---
<Default title="About Us" desc="About us">
    <!-- Animation -->
    <div class="flex justify-center">
        <video class="w-[50%]" controls autoplay>
            <source src="/Sweet-Hedges-Farm/animation.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
    </div>

    <div class="my-6">
        <h2>What is Deforestation?</h2>
        <p>
            Deforestation is one of the biggest environmental issues that are plaguing our planet. Large number of trees are
            cut down since they are used for many things e.g. fuel. However, deforestation can lead to climate change and such
            because trees are very important in ensuring that doesn't happen.

            <br><br>

            Trees give oxygen to us all which pretty much all living beings require to breathe. They also consume any carbon
            dioxide from the atmosphere which keeps global warming in check which in turn also stops climate change as
            carbon dioxide is one of the greenhouse gases which means it can trap heat from the sun in the Earth's
            atmosphere.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Information about deforestation -->
    <div class="flex justify-center">
        <iframe
            width="560"
            height="315"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/P_bJjPR4Xog?si=385Ww19PALlvGcp1"
            title="YouTube video player"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
    </div>
</Default>